      "t": "2026-11-13T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "The Royal Spanish Football Federation suspended FC Andorra goalkeeper Jesús Owono for 12 matches after a November 2 collision with Tenerife forward Jesús de Miguel, which caused de Miguel's death.",
